<title>FRANCE: Suez to eliminate treasury stock.</title>
<headline>Suez to eliminate treasury stock.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compagnie de Suez said on Wednesday that its board had agreed to eliminate the group's treasury stock.</p>
<p>Suez said in its half-year earnings statement that in 1995 and 1996 it bought back convertible bonds issued in 1993 ahead of maturity, eliminating a potential two percent dilution of its capital.</p>
<p>&quot;The board has approved the principle of eliminating the entire treasury stock (five percent),&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
